ndar. place is always clean and a fun crowd. they take cards! stop in here before hitting up frenchman, thats usually what i do!"},{"business_id":"KXO2vfYa82eh4jBskltAFg","review_id":"fOmTzbRndXZCOc3llVRYmQ","date":"2017-04-03T17:43:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9216073155403137,"text_excerpt":"Santos is the newest incarnation at this spot at 1135 Decatur. It seems there have been A LOT of different bars here over the years, but since this bar is owned and operated by the same people who run The Saint on St. Mary, hopefully it will stick. We were here semi-early on a Saturday night and it was pretty quiet. I do like the vibe here- it's a little spooky and cool and there's a nice dance floor where I assume they will have music. They have some good local beers on tap, which is always a plus for me and the bartender was friendly. The bar seems a lot nicer than when other businesses were here- I'm not sure if they have done a full on renovation, but I like what they've done with the..."},{"business_id":"KXO2vfYa82eh4jBskltAFg","review_id":"yia41oC1e26kgp3GQibarQ","date":"2019-11-17T02:46:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.902530312538147,"text_excerpt":"Dive bar Mecca . Cool bartenders no hassle just laid back outcast bar. Most of the nights a show without bouncers flexing. Always a fun time and one of the few clubs you can open a tab a never worry about overcharging."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"KXO2vfYa82eh4jBskltAFg","photo_id":"Rv2wba_toj00c5y4f2xX-g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Rv2wba_toj00c5y4f2xX-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9999999403953552}]},"notebook_case":null}
